WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,010
Mother

2
00:00:01,110 --> 00:00:02,110
This thing is not a Buddha's hand

3
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:03,610
I don’t want to bring it to Brother Yaqin either.

4
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,110
It's definitely not Buddha's hand

5
00:00:05,610 --> 00:00:07,110
The neck and shell are different.

6
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:09,110
But if it’s not Buddha’s hand, what is this?

7
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:10,610
This is called Ejingteng Lake

8
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:11,610
Good stuff to straighten your ears and neck

9
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:13,110
It is said that foreigners especially like to eat

10
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:15,110
Originally, I wanted to sell it to Ma Tou’s fish rice zi.

11
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:16,110
But they don't know

12
00:00:16,110 --> 00:00:17,610
I plan to stop by the county town

13
00:00:17,610 --> 00:00:19,110
See if I can sell it, but my son

14
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:20,610
You said no one knows him

15
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:21,610
No one recognizes his value

16
00:00:21,610 --> 00:00:23,610
Then why are you selling it? Don’t you mean?

17
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:26,610
You don’t even know Yufanzi, who has a lot of swords and knowledge? You want me to tell you?

18
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:27,610
You'd better stop trying

19
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:29,110
Anyway, everything is already in hand

20
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:30,610
I'm just going to try my luck.

21
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:32,110
If no one really knows

22
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:34,110
At worst, we can cook and eat them ourselves.

23
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:36,000
That's all it can do
